# >>> kbmail managed (refreshed by `kbmail init --upgrade`; put your own rules outside this block) >>>
#
# Tracked: what you and Copilot authored, plus what delta runs need to continue on another machine:
#   wiki/, raw/ (formatted sources), config/, kbmail.yaml, AGENTS.md, .github/, .vscode/,
#   .env.example, review/questions.yaml, review/images/descriptions.yaml + *.mmd,
#   state/{labels,kb_selection,kb_convert,images,runs}.json, state/wiki_*, state/rules_history/
# Ignored: the raw mail export (re-exportable from Outlook), generated queues, secrets, binaries.
# Before pushing anything: `kbmail git check` (also runs as the .githooks/pre-commit hook).

